[1]
elegiste, (eh-leh-HEES-teh), You chose / You picked (Simple Past tense of the verb elegir - to choose).

aburrido, (ah-boo-RREE-doh), Bored / Boring (Adjective).

general, (heh-neh-RAHL), General (Noun/Adjective).

considera, (kohn-see-deh-RAH), Is considered (Third person singular of the verb considerar - to consider, used here in the impersonal se structure).

algo, (AHL-goh), Something (Indefinite pronoun).

malo, (MAH-loh), Bad (Adjective).
